  "structure": {
    "block_count": 121,
    "blocks": [
      {
        "block_id": "block_000000",
        "block_index": 0,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h1",
        "text": "I Got the Babylist Welcome Box — Here’s What’s Inside the $8.95 Box Everyone Talks About",
        "text_sha256": "5443e436e7f6504df8afe3693af40ebeb1d08a532b73c24015570e80ee41c627",
        "word_count": 16
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000001",
        "block_index": 1,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "2025 Babylist Welcome Box",
        "text_sha256": "333b8b215e3f1936879f463bcf382942e092bbbc4b296a9ce4bff45672189a9b",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000002",
        "block_index": 2,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Curious about the Babylist Welcome Box (a.k.a. Hello Baby Box)? Here’s what was inside my 2026 box — from full-size gear to sample essentials.",
        "text_sha256": "5c13c3338be2bd32e5c40f37282baf811c188d03da05176d28979f85536bba86",
        "word_count": 24
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000003",
        "block_index": 3,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Just so you know, What to Expect may earn commissions from the shopping links included on this page. All sales and prices are accurate at the time of publishing.",
        "text_sha256": "1922c3fea76d4f2a6f4ade63feb42972a2bb42e22c26d8117381d8356cd35012",
        "word_count": 29
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000004",
        "block_index": 4,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Babylist Welcome Box Quick Review",
        "text_sha256": "b929bfbce4c9c5d6b7c909a0b5409c7986bc074b8d78beb2982d2c3cce9026d2",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000005",
        "block_index": 5,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "The Babylist Welcome Box is filled with a sweet mix of baby gear — and the contents change regularly, so it’s always a bit of a surprise.",
        "text_sha256": "e5e6399ac28d3ec9b46e9b550cb9bd5d1b1cf24dbea951e815d398beca757409",
        "word_count": 27
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000006",
        "block_index": 6,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "As of August 2025, you’ll find sample-sized goodies from Huggies, Honest Company, and Tubby Todd.",
        "text_sha256": "55bd6c44433266d3f2c439dd423306097223bf34de3f89c3752c34308d0e6392",
        "word_count": 15
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000007",
        "block_index": 7,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Feeding time is covered, too, with gear from Dr. Brown’s, Momcozy, and Lansinoh.",
        "text_sha256": "e84a6d1cd74dfa4b44c6c89271b6bcc7a0e152f8c66960de805034735cc4dff5",
        "word_count": 13
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000008",
        "block_index": 8,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "There’s also baby clothing from Kyte and Primary, plus coupons to help you save on more must-haves.",
        "text_sha256": "6274772b30981ca08e10ef232330d604caccf0e98873cc16f1883b0a79c21b7c",
        "word_count": 17
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000009",
        "block_index": 9,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "The small shipping fee of $8.95 is worth it for a box valued at $100 — and possibly more once you count the coupons.",
        "text_sha256": "89f96d205e4504bb1c1d018baa2497faff8e0918077b60589d1e03676c08d0d1",
        "word_count": 24
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000010",
        "block_index": 10,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "When I was pregnant with my first baby, I rushed into creating a baby registry without knowing all the best-kept registry hacks . Now, as a soon-to-be mom of two, I’m older, wiser, and far more strategic — which is why signing up for a Babylist registry (and snagging their famous Welcome Box ) was at the top of my to-do list.",
        "text_sha256": "ff0498f81b4f150fa892197b91b9f8c8340888b61af73a8607630816f38aa823",
        "word_count": 62
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000011",
        "block_index": 11,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Over the years, friends have raved about the variety of trusted brands tucked inside — think Huggies, Tubby Todd, Dr. Brown’s, and more. Caroline Picard , What to Expect’s deputy editor and new mom, puts it best:",
        "text_sha256": "67f9c903100f454a3ffc6e4bde950069d45481fa560ce0c1094cb287137df357",
        "word_count": 37
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000012",
        "block_index": 12,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "“Calling the Babylist Welcome Box ‘generous’ feels like an understatement,” says Caroline. “One of the highlights for me was the selection of diapers, wipes, and butt cream samples. While they’re not big-ticket items, the cost of experimenting with different brands adds up.\"",
        "text_sha256": "0452f71a46b618ac4ce3bdfd0703a85152746737f607e8b4355e882892e6df19",
        "word_count": 42
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000013",
        "block_index": 13,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "And she’s right — for just $8.95 in shipping, you get over $100 worth of baby gear. That’s money saved and decision-making made easier (and yes, maybe even a little sanity preserved).",
        "text_sha256": "e1a4bf83f16f3260390bd873ccd82af2e0355b3838da70bf02539999950954f1",
        "word_count": 32
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000014",
        "block_index": 14,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Having a chance to test several without committing to full-size purchases felt like a real win.",
        "text_sha256": "ec73c0645a612499f48d632f2a25b8c6ec653ee7c2dbec023c2fa16a2b75ddeb",
        "word_count": 16
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000015",
        "block_index": 15,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Caroline Picard, What to Expect Deputy Editor and mom of one",
        "text_sha256": "a30ce0bea0bc7b5c952d099d7ab60984f09198e6d131a7e39cce8c9b4f684cf0",
        "word_count": 11
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000016",
        "block_index": 16,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "What’s Inside the Babylist Welcome Box 2026",
        "text_sha256": "15863061ea345e5212649e52626f23bbb93792a9c0ccd9b9d4d0cdb294146435",
        "word_count": 7
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000017",
        "block_index": 17,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "The 2026 Babylist Welcome Box proves that good things really do come in small packages. My spring box included baby clothing, feeding gear, postpartum treats, and a surprising number of coupons for free or discounted goodies.",
        "text_sha256": "567183ebbc49b5fe09660bf1cd64e60071006c292192a0b59f0f37f66c9e6078",
        "word_count": 36
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000018",
        "block_index": 18,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "The 2026 Babylist Welcome Box: Huggies Skin Essential Diapers and Primary Bodysuit",
        "text_sha256": "3795ba962013e1f26831433fd0d2e243c6fe9833f38e256976a55a5449a81d18",
        "word_count": 12
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000019",
        "block_index": 19,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "The 2026 Babylist Welcome Box is well-stocked with samples from beloved brands.",
        "text_sha256": "86f14a1a7c55fac1b7a2fb2c4df256d7f239bc7badc9570feea6381e9f761b35",
        "word_count": 12
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000020",
        "block_index": 20,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "According to Babylist (and the many What to Expect Community threads I’ve scrolled through), the box’s contents change about twice a year. So what your sister-in-law got last fall might not be what you find inside yours this spring — but the variety and quality stay consistent.",
        "text_sha256": "6327f2f43e8e6a969f60678410271d1e1adc10ae8d35e7586035d4b1bd3f8e68",
        "word_count": 47
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000021",
        "block_index": 21,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Here’s what was inside my spring 2026 Babylist Welcome Box:",
        "text_sha256": "56b0831a98ccc4131c173bded898ead69a562b5f16cd2e735a74e82f22c632bf",
        "word_count": 10
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000022",
        "block_index": 22,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Full-size Products:",
        "text_sha256": "4f67dd209b610164e0f3bd24ad69bf1628eb88300b2b0c7fc0062dc57d3160c7",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000023",
        "block_index": 23,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "The 2026 Babylist Welcome Box: On the left, a white Kyte bodysuit with porcupines. On the right, a Primary body suit that's white with suns and rainbows.",
        "text_sha256": "dbb4fb9a8885aa6bcca1062b7d13bad8abc517d0e6db34053221fa2a4c620443",
        "word_count": 27
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000024",
        "block_index": 24,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "One of my favorite items in the 2026 Babylist Welcome Box: Soft bodysuits from Kyte Baby and Primary.",
        "text_sha256": "c04f6b4c0a9f22cb839a9c2f8aaad2e1371daf1c16f17f7aa7649d0a187a7634",
        "word_count": 18
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000025",
        "block_index": 25,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Primary “Hello Sunshine” bodysuit (3-6 months)",
        "text_sha256": "0693d80b5a6b48ff7ed70944a090db779a3f70fd96cc7cc25f817c51e5d5573d",
        "word_count": 6
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000026",
        "block_index": 26,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Kyte Baby bodysuit (0-3 months)",
        "text_sha256": "59b5d65d618c02845bb09dfd669ac7a459b41593e4b8fffd649ee3026aed00e7",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000027",
        "block_index": 27,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Dr. Brown’s Natural Flow Anti-Colic Options+ Narrow Baby Bottle (4 oz.)",
        "text_sha256": "c54501166a19740cbe775b2a2c56e30ad2fa382f91f99b9c20c39a6dcea26602",
        "word_count": 11
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000028",
