        "text": "10 free Shutterfly birth announcements",
        "text_sha256": "a452efb93aec5ac7ea9ac9ce9a68bc85bb1f8640a439986d33183f7bc0264ae3",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000059",
        "block_index": 59,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "It’s a low-cost way to try trusted brands without fully committing to products that may not work for your baby.",
        "text_sha256": "6e7a5131a185e871dc02b2111ce87e3dea5aace6a0a5a44f5fd2bdc5971da102",
        "word_count": 20
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000060",
        "block_index": 60,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "How to Get the Babylist Welcome Box",
        "text_sha256": "981f386a6e660e9663778198679fbd889a88e51b3be15c2945a89229a899b02d",
        "word_count": 7
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000061",
        "block_index": 61,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Start a Babylist registry .",
        "text_sha256": "bbd5fec7702e9b7d3d1eac6cf7249fe52f16a8af93aea0075607653346fb3d3e",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000062",
        "block_index": 62,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Add at least 40% of items from the Babylist registry checklist.",
        "text_sha256": "b33e1dfd98973f4d4622d5104e7adc7a97843446989d2645ebcaedaeaca0f2c3",
        "word_count": 11
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000063",
        "block_index": 63,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Add three items from other stores.",
        "text_sha256": "7d4688e8b5f73d395a64bed35c2e9ca19de734684253db53e8bda7988fb25aa2",
        "word_count": 6
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000064",
        "block_index": 64,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Make a $30 purchase from the Babylist Shop (or wait for a gift-giver to do it).",
        "text_sha256": "203292e0a47b5c09c36701a50d1c64e86a1ac14205e2eac0fffb21400fbd3bd8",
        "word_count": 16
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000065",
        "block_index": 65,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Verify your address and pay $8.95 for shipping.",
        "text_sha256": "a4ed965c69204ea6d589a280c77038d2b1309be18b45b364ad9e68fca6645909",
        "word_count": 8
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000066",
        "block_index": 66,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Even though I already had a lot from my first pregnancy, meeting the criteria was easier than expected. Exclusive Babylist bundles like the Bottle Box and Pacifier Box made it simple to fill in gaps.",
        "text_sha256": "bf9ad4af2c7463cc1e45aa6afa0cf1514d2a50d4c840d83d55c9441cf9936610",
        "word_count": 35
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000067",
        "block_index": 67,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Caroline, on the other hand, used Babylist as her primary registry and said meeting the criteria was a breeze.",
        "text_sha256": "8747c0f12d48f9932eb5b1c209ceb45c2cd53a470e7e2280990a4853914dffc0",
        "word_count": 19
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000068",
        "block_index": 68,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "How Does Babylist Compare to Other Registry Welcome Boxes?",
        "text_sha256": "71517b757ebe10f744b4fef13185860994de355ba42754155cf663ffba473229",
        "word_count": 9
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000069",
        "block_index": 69,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Compared to the Amazon Welcome Box, the Babylist Welcome Box comes out ahead in both quantity and brand quality. Caroline especially appreciated the inclusion of products for moms — something other boxes sometimes skip.",
        "text_sha256": "1cc3b07fb68881bd76dc83aca571fe5c105ccd1c795cd3c29ac094ac932d0135",
        "word_count": 34
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000070",
        "block_index": 70,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Yes, the $8.95 shipping fee is a minor downside, especially since some registry welcome boxes are free. But with a retail value of $100, it’s an easy decision for me.",
        "text_sha256": "5422e6dddc17e10041c32575779614369a0df3c5a54c5ea8e23e4b1e69990cac",
        "word_count": 30
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000071",
        "block_index": 71,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Is the Babylist Welcome Box Worth It?",
        "text_sha256": "c4de623f4178f08db1191b8b544b0318049a2b8949a2edf686cd920e4808a040",
        "word_count": 7
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000072",
        "block_index": 72,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Between the generous mix of full-size products, the variety of sample-size items , and the stack of coupons for even more freebies, the Babylist Welcome Box is worth far more than the small shipping fee.",
        "text_sha256": "78bae0585ebfe5951adba58697f68b675b7601d89712fee6427632189722a0b3",
        "word_count": 35
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000073",
        "block_index": 73,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "The 2026 Babylist Welcome Box",
        "text_sha256": "9c0edee1ac319c6cf57f472baeed9b9957ff963c2d5b3607f8a48801afc14ec7",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000074",
        "block_index": 74,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "In short: The Babylist Welcome Box contains $100-worth of baby items that you'll be happy to have on hand.",
        "text_sha256": "ba93b0eb89b80c1741c4bd96c16784c051f29f4889a1df3671e12baf52ba1fe8",
        "word_count": 19
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000075",
        "block_index": 75,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "It’s a low-cost way to try trusted brands without fully committing — and as any parent knows, what works for one baby might not work for the next. Even though I know which products Olivia liked, Baby #2 could have entirely different preferences. Consider this box your test-drive for baby gear, with plenty of perks along the way.",
        "text_sha256": "5b2ff59461e92025f938dace3addaa8942439619c2f4c739f9cd874cb4741937",
        "word_count": 58
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000076",
        "block_index": 76,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "In short: Add the Babylist Welcome Box to your registry checklist — your budget (and your curiosity) will thank you.",
        "text_sha256": "713b0ca0bf76869f82040061c7a5d1ebec17e6ae1af7b34321e10209c624d80d",
        "word_count": 20
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000077",
        "block_index": 77,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Babylist Welcome Box FAQ",
        "text_sha256": "cc4e06fa63030d4efd8932e133fe548f38ae3e3ca56bb7ef5323e283f81dd22a",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000078",
        "block_index": 78,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h4",
        "text": "Can international users receive the box?",
        "text_sha256": "5463ad56bfab22c90c804478d229341c0b7409fbd47db272a26c00950fcdf786",
        "word_count": 6
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000079",
        "block_index": 79,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Unfortunately, the Babylist Welcome Box is only available to U.S. residents At this time, it can’t be shipped internationally or to APO (Army Post Office), FPO (Fleet Post Office), or DPO (Diplomatic Post Office) addresses.",
        "text_sha256": "cbf928cff92597e1d4e238417b45faf0b1041b362d43edea034c1af87c0e0cf0",
        "word_count": 35
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000080",
        "block_index": 80,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h4",
        "text": "What brands are typically included in the Babylist Welcome Box?",
        "text_sha256": "de9e8f0f2d29fa2bfb4776d8affdf87d281c537c5357cc6949663ae714bd4790",
        "word_count": 10
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000081",
        "block_index": 81,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
