      {
        "block_id": "block_000103",
        "block_index": 103,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h4",
        "text": "Are the products in the Babylist Welcome Box sized for newborns only?",
        "text_sha256": "5d34f36030f03508824e11d822fd1dd8dfb3fc88562023b9614654d5d83fbb65",
        "word_count": 12
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000104",
        "block_index": 104,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "The clothing in the Babylist Welcome Box is usually sized for newborns or 0 to 3 months. Non-clothing items can often be used well into your baby’s first six months — and in some cases, even longer.",
        "text_sha256": "8fbd20cbbd9b9f41362b5add090ae13a2d6e2f269ff76ff524561ea520a40bc4",
        "word_count": 37
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000105",
        "block_index": 105,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h4",
        "text": "Can someone trigger the $30 Babylist Welcome Box purchase on my behalf?",
        "text_sha256": "d6345d3b268e31dd3a019495213b571b926bcfb6a0fd46b2a4d7aed6543b72e9",
        "word_count": 12
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000106",
        "block_index": 106,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Yes! If someone buys a gift of $30 or more from your Babylist registry, it counts toward the purchase requirement for the Babylist Welcome Box. But if you’re as excited (and impatient) as I was, you can always make the purchase yourself and get your box on the way sooner.",
